  "system": {
    "identifier": "sundering-strike",
    "description": "<p>You swing your polearm, flooded with chakra meant to break an enemy’s offensive posture. Make a melee Taijutsu Attack, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 3d6 on a hit and forcing them to make a Strength saving throw, gaining a rank of Weakened on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: On a failed save the affected creature increases the cost of the next jutsu they cast by +4 as you inject the built-up chakra into their chakra network.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
